# =============================================================================
# .gitattributes — Git LFS tracking for shipped model files
# =============================================================================
#
# Description:
#   Shipped parser model files in public/models/ are stored with Git LFS
#   (architecture.md → Model training → Artifacts; agents.md → Training code).
#   Only public/models/ is tracked; training/ exports are git-ignored.
#
# Tasks:
#   1. Every contributor installs git-lfs and runs `git lfs install` once
#      (plan-training.md → Phase pre-0).
#   2. Deployment must check out LFS files (not pointer files) before building.
#
# Dependencies:
#   git-lfs. Files produced by training/scripts/export_onnx.py (Phase 11).
# =============================================================================

public/models/**/*.onnx filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
public/models/**/*.onnx_data filter=lfs diff=lfs merge=lfs -text
